{"id":"3170ce92c093aa58","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-biconditional.md","title":"逐句与统一真理双条件","display":"df-truth-biconditional — 逐句与统一真理双条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-biconditional","aliases":["91-df-truth-biconditional","91-df-T-biconditional","91-df-disquotation-biconditional"],"display":"df-truth-biconditional — 逐句与统一真理双条件","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-ground-language]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-biconditional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-biconditional</span><span>91-df-T-biconditional</span><span>91-df-disquotation-biconditional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-biconditional — 逐句与统一真理双条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-biconditional-—-逐句与统一真理双条件-$\\mathrm{TBicond}$\">df-truth-biconditional — 逐句与统一真理双条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TBicond}\">\\(\\mathrm{TBicond}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (一元真理谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\\)</span> (无捕获的同步代入编码函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TBicond}_{T}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TBicond}_{T}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UTBicond}_{T}(\\theta)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec x))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta(\\vec x)\n\\bigr)\n\\qquad\n(\\theta(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UTBicond}_{T}(\\theta)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec x))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta(\\vec x)\n\\bigr)\n\\qquad\n(\\theta(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式对每个固定句子给出一个实例；第二式对每个固定公式给出一个对象\n语言全称闭包。二者都是元层的公理模式，不能写成对象语言量化公式变量的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\">\\(\\forall\\varphi\\)</span> 单句。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论/语义</th>\n<th>正确的双条件说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>每个基础语言句子的逐句实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTB</td>\n<td>每个基础语言公式的带参数统一实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span></td>\n<td>由基础原子与组合公理恢复基础语言双条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>基础语言上恢复双条件；强 Kleene 固定点中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\varphi\">\\(T\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 同值，但这不等于经典理论证明全语言透明式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>捕获/释放给定理层面的双向可推规则，不等于把所有自指双条件作为对象公理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>若经典逻辑中的自指理论对整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 加入\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\)</span>，\n说谎者实例会导致\n矛盾。这个结论不需要也不能通过假设 FS 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性来避免；\n事实上标准 FS 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致的，但语法上一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-biconditional-—-逐句与统一真理双条件-$\\mathrm{TBicond}$","text":"df-truth-biconditional — 逐句与统一真理双条件 $\\mathrm{TBicond}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TBicond}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{TBicond}_{T}(\\varphi)\n\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\qquad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}biconditional}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UTBicond}_{T}(\\theta)\n\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\bigl(\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\theta\\urcorner},\\vec x))\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta(\\vec x)\n\\bigr)\n\\qquad\n(\\theta(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2220,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-biconditional]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[9